2️⃣1️⃣ Average Changes

A group has 10 students with average age 20.

A student aged 30 joins.

Old sum:

\[
10\times20=200
\]

New sum:

\[
230
\]

New average:

\[
230/11
\]

\[
\boxed{20.91}
\]

So the average increases, but only slightly.


