🔥 2️⃣2️⃣ Replacement Problem

Average of 10 numbers = 50.

One number, 30, is replaced by 70.

Old sum:

\[
10\times50=500
\]

Change:

\[
70-30=40
\]

New sum:

\[
540
\]

New average:

\[
540/10
\]

\[
\boxed{54}
\]

Shortcut:

\[
\boxed{
New\ Average=
Old\ Average+
\frac{New-Old}{n}
}
\]


